{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1261720-uncle-yo-s-chroniclers-of-darkness-audio-play-podcasts","id":1261720,"title":"Uncle Yo's Chroniclers of Darkness - Audio Play Podcasts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-19T22:01:16-07:00","id":1261720,"title":"Uncle Yo's Chroniclers of Darkness - Audio Play Podcasts","content":"...kinda surprised that no one has mentioned this here, but yeah.<br /> <br /> Uncle Yo, famed geek comedian, is actually a huge fan of Chronicles of Darkness. So much so that, a few years ago, he apparently held a panel where he would try to summarize, and pitch, all of the CofD gamelines in 10 minutes to each. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5neAkoQA_7MDtFOoTaqWbHl\" target=\"_blank\">Playlist here.</a><br /> <br /> (and apparently he did discuss Mummy, Demon, and Beast, but the camera's battery died so no footage)<br /> <br /> But from there he and other voice actors and the like collaborated together to make audio drama podcasts for each gameline. In seasone 1 he did:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRNrp6ne7u4Lb0yql5dG5VCjwbSXVhBdm\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: the Requiem - &quot;Be Kine to Your Neighbors&quot;</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRNrp6ne7u4IKQFTayyw4Le2XE85Os8JL\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: the Lost - &quot;Down the Rabbit Hole&quot;</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5n_QTWpYfnBsN19BmWKvodg\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter: the Vigil - &quot;Neighborhood Watch&quot;</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRNrp6ne7u4KNFR1NzH8uV6zPbnuTE03l\" target=\"_blank\">Geist: the Sin Eaters - &quot;Tombstone Kings of Queens&quot;</a><br /> <br /> Season 2 has started and now he's doing Geist and Changeling again, but he's also doing new ones for Werewolf, Mage, Promethean, and Demon. Geist s2 is already finished, and Promethean is two episodes in.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5kMuEfYiG97O2_T39EeCycH\" target=\"_blank\">Geist: the Sin Eaters season 2 </a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5koqeyk-4dkZCdyNWzP_Rru\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean: the Created </a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5kkr8kPYQuktN6y9WSjRJP7\" target=\"_blank\">Mage: the Awakening - &quot;Mind over Matter&quot;</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5nhQ-j3tHyq5EReJjUgC3ky\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: the Descent - &quot;God-Complex&quot;</a><br /> <br /> Season 3<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLixJK8l5vk5lfSNnylj7uT0rhAK1vfVUy\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: the Lost 2e mini-series - &quot;The Vatheck's Oath&quot; </a><br /> <br /> Edit 1: Added Mage playlist.<br /> Edit 2: <a href=\"http://wearethegeek.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Non-YT website here.</a><br /> Edit 3: Added Demon playlist<br /> Edit 4: Added Changeling 2e playlist","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 06-15-2019, 01:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T22:04:30-07:00","id":1261721,"title":"","content":"That's awesome! It would sick if he did some for Dark Eras too! <br /> <br /> (Although I am admittedly quite biased in that regard.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T22:14:54-07:00","id":1261725,"title":"","content":"Also, why I have no idea the production timeline for these things, some of these are obviously referencing 1e and not 2e.<br /> <br /> For instance, while Geist 2e was released months before the s2 Geist audio plays were released, it still mostly sticks with 1e canon. So it would be likely that these episodes were made long before the Geist 2e KS draft dropped.<br /> <br /> Although, the jury is out on Changeling s2 will be referencing the updated material from 2e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_li