ignature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 04-27-2019, 03:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-03T09:06:48-07:00","id":1309663,"title":"","content":"Firstly, that on-boarding took longer than it takes me to produce an episode.<br /> <br /> Secondly, thank you so much Tasti for spreading the podcast and the stories. I was blown away to see the recognition. I love the intense questions because it proves you're listening intently, and I can't express what a joy that is to have people outside my head as invested in the characters and the larger world mysteries as I am. I'm filming some things for an upcoming Changeling 2nd Ed...well, you'll see, this coming Monday, hopefully posting up before the end of the month.<br /> <br /> Again, thank you for the kind words and spreading awareness.<br /> <br /> ~Yo","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25278-uncle_yo","name":"Uncle_Yo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-03T23:29:51-07:00","id":1309868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uncle_Yo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.